    "text": {
     "en": "A point marks an exact position and has no size. A line segment joins two points and has a fixed length.\nA line goes on forever in both directions. A ray starts at one point and goes on forever in one direction, like a torch beam.\nTwo rays meeting at a common end point form an angle."
    }
